@startuml STM-1
!include _style.iuml
title STM-1 (System level) — Lifecycle of a ChargingSession\nsessions.status · v1.1 · 10/11/2026

state c0 <<choice>>
[*] -down-> c0
note right of c0
  created when the Charge Point accepts
  a start request from the Driver App,
  or reports a session it started itself
  (card, password, free vend)
end note
c0 -down-> pending : [start request\nfrom the Driver App]
c0 -down-> Running : [started at the\nCharge Point]\n/ classify card,\nset payment mode

state "Running" as Running {
  [*] -down-> active
  active -right-> paused : vehicle or Charge Point\npauses charging
  paused -left-> active : charging resumes
  active -down-> stopping : Driver stops, limit reached\nor credit at cutoff\n/ ask Charge Point to stop
  paused -down-> stopping : Driver stops\n/ ask Charge Point to stop
  stopping -up-> active : Charge Point refuses\nto stop / tell Driver
  stopping : no stop reply in 30 s\n/ resend (max 3, 30 s apart),\nthen flag for the Operator
}

pending -right-> Running : Charge Point\nconfirms start
pending -down-> failed : after(120 s)\n/ tell Driver, no charge
note left of pending
  App start: pending and failed are held on
  the start request (driver_charge_intents:
  accepted / released + start_timeout); the
  sessions row is created in active when the
  Charge Point reports the start. No reply to
  the start in 30 s: outcome unknown, credit
  stays held until the Operator fences it.
end note
failed -down-> [*]

Running -down-> closed : Charge Point reports stop\n(Driver, limit, battery full\nor at the Charge Point)
Running --> orphaned : Charge Point\noffline for 120 s\n/ void reservations
orphaned --> Running : live data of\nthe session resumes

closed -down-> reconciled : energy check consistent
closed -down-> review : energy check conflict\n/ hold billing
orphaned -down-> reconciled : stop data replayed,\nenergy check consistent
orphaned -down-> review : stop data replayed, energy\ncheck conflict, or after(24 h\nin orphaned) / hold billing
review -left-> reconciled : Operator resolves\n/ record decision
reconciled -right-> review : late data changes the result\n[credit not yet debited]
reconciled -down-> [*] : charge settled\n/ price per tariff period,\ndebit credit, award points,\nsend statement
note left of reconciled
  Only csms_billed sessions (app
  or RFID card) are settled;
  unattributed sessions stay
  reconciled (no debit).
end note

note bottom of Running
  Running groups active, paused, stopping;
  it is not a status value. Entering Running
  starts in active.
end note
@enduml
